; Last Stand: made by Voxcade's composer (tools/compose.py in Voxcade's source)
; from its recipe music/last_stand.compose.toml (action, E minor, 150 bpm,
; seed 6). Neither comes with a game: change the song here, by hand.
; Chords from free-midi-chords by Ludovic Drolez (MIT).
;
; A: im bIIIM IV V (modal): Em G A B
; B: I bIIIM bVIIM I (modal): E G D E
; Form, 8 bars each: intro A | theme A | theme A | bridge B | bridge B | break A | theme A | bridge B | theme A | bridge B | theme A | turn B
; Variation: most (every fourth bar walks and pushes, the broken chords turn, ghost notes on the hi-hat, later themes answer backwards).

#title Last Stand
#tempo 150

